    "model_design": "Increase all dropout probabilities from 0.3 to 0.4 and replace BatchNorm1d with LayerNorm in the tfidf_branch and stylo_branch. This directly addresses the overfitting gap (train loss 0.31 vs val 0.69) as historical experiments showed similar adjustments narrowing the gap by ~0.15. LayerNorm is more robust for heterogeneous features and stabilizes training with high LR. Implementation: modify Sequential blocks in MultiInputClassifier, keeping all layer dimensions and the CrossAttentionFusion module identical. Interface: MultiInputClassifier class signature and forward unchanged."
