_factor=1e4) and increase total epochs to 30. This schedule provides immediate high LR for faster convergence, then anneals to near-zero to prevent overfitting, aligning with successful historical experiments. Reduce gradient clipping max_norm from 1.0 to 0.5 to stabilize training with higher LR. Keep all other training hyperparameters unchanged. Implementation: modify scheduler initialization in train_and_evaluate(), update total_epochs, and adjust patience to 10 to accommodate OneCycleLR's later peak. Interface: train_and_evaluate() signature unchanged. After first training, implement pseudo-label retraining phase: load augmented dataset, reinitialize model, train with OneCycleLR (max_lr=5e-4, same pct_start/div_factor) for 20 epochs with weight_decay=0.2."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
